  "waiting for the console on UDP 18194": "",
  "RetroAchievements login": "",
  "hacan359": "",
  "· signed in, only the token is stored": "",
  "Web API key": "",
  "SAVE": "",
  "Both fields can wait: the library needs the key, an unlock needs the login.": "",
  "Boot OPL-RA and test the link": "",
  "On the console: Apps → <strong>OPL+RA</strong>. It looks and behaves like OPL 1.2.0. Highlight a game, press <kbd>△</kbd> for its menu and choose <strong>RA: test PC connection</strong>. A notice tells you whether xerabora answered, from which address and how fast.": "",
  "Nothing answers? Same subnet, PC firewall allows inbound UDP 18194, the client is running.": "",
